{"seq":2,"slug":"schema-definition-formats","title":"Schema 定义格式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/schema-evolution-data-contracts/foundations/schema-definition-formats","wordCount":1403,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"schema-定义格式\">Schema 定义格式</h1><p>选择哪种格式来描述数据结构，表面上是序列化效率的技术选型，实质上决定了 schema 演进时你有多少操作空间。Avro 靠 reader/writer schema 协商在运行时解析兼容性，Protobuf 靠字段编号把兼容性刻进线缆格式，JSON Schema 靠 open/closed content model 在验证时决定容忍度。三种哲学，三种约束，三种适用场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>格式即演进契约</strong>：选择哪种 schema 格式，实质决定了 schema 演进时有多少操作空间。</li>\n<li><strong>Avro</strong>：以 schema 为中心，靠 reader/writer schema 协商在运行时解析兼容性，字段按名称匹配，强依赖 Schema Registry。</li>\n<li><strong>Protobuf</strong>：字段编号即契约，兼容性刻进线缆格式，重命名安全（编号不变），但类型变更极度受限。</li>\n<li><strong>JSON Schema</strong>：面向 HTTP 世界的验证规范，用 <code>additionalProperties</code> 这一开关在 open/closed content model 之间取舍兼容性方向。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"avro-以-schema-为中心的演进\">Avro：以 Schema 为中心的演进</h2><p>Apache Avro 的核心设计是&quot;数据不带自描述结构&quot;——序列化后的字节流里没有字段名，全靠配套的 schema 来解读。这意味着读写双方各持一份 schema（writer schema 和 reader schema），反序列化时由框架进行字段匹配与类型转换。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;type&quot;: &quot;record&quot;,&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;OrderEvent&quot;,&#10;  &quot;namespace&quot;: &quot;com.shop.events&quot;,&#10;  &quot;fields&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;order_id&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;amount_cents&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;long&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;created_at&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;long&quot;, &quot;logicalType&quot;: &quot;timestamp-millis&quot; } },&#10;    { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;currency&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;, &quot;default&quot;: &quot;CNY&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;note&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: [&quot;null&quot;, &quot;string&quot;], &quot;default&quot;: null }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"record\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"OrderEvent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"namespace\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"com.shop.events\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"fields\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"string\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"amount_cents\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"long\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"created_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"long\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"logicalType\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"timestamp-millis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"string\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CNY\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"note\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"null\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"string\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>演进机制</strong>：字段匹配按名称进行。新增字段必须提供默认值（reader schema 中有而 writer schema 中无时用默认值填充）；删除字段时 reader 直接忽略。类型提升（int→long、float→double）由框架自动处理。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant W as Writer (v1 schema)&#10;    participant SR as Schema Registry&#10;    participant R as Reader (v2 schema)&#10;    W-&gt;&gt;SR: 注册 writer schema v1&#10;    W-&gt;&gt;R: 发送序列化数据 (无字段名)&#10;    R-&gt;&gt;SR: 获取 writer schema v1&#10;    R-&gt;&gt;R: 用 v2 reader schema 解析&lt;br/&gt;新字段用默认值填充&lt;br/&gt;旧字段按名称匹配\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant W as Writer (v1 schema)\n    participant SR as Schema Registry\n    participant R as Reader (v2 schema)\n    W-&gt;&gt;SR: 注册 writer schema v1\n    W-&gt;&gt;R: 发送序列化数据 (无字段名)\n    R-&gt;&gt;SR: 获取 writer schema v1\n    R-&gt;&gt;R: 用 v2 reader schema 解析&lt;br/&gt;新字段用默认值填充&lt;br/&gt;旧字段按名称匹配</pre><p><strong>优势</strong>：紧凑（无字段名开销）、动态语言友好（运行时解析 schema，无需代码生成）、类型演进灵活（union 类型允许一个字段从 <code>string</code> 扩展为 <code>[&quot;string&quot;, &quot;int&quot;]</code>）。</p>\n<p><strong>劣势</strong>：强依赖 Schema Registry（丢失 schema 则数据不可读）、字段重命名等于&quot;删旧加新&quot;（按名称匹配）、嵌套结构演进复杂。</p>\n<h2 id=\"protobuf-字段编号即契约\">Protobuf：字段编号即契约</h2><p>Protocol Buffers 把兼容性保证刻进了序列化格式本身。每个字段有一个唯一的数字编号（field number），线缆上传输的是编号+值对，而非名称+值对。旧代码遇到未知编号直接跳过，新代码遇到缺失编号用默认零值。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"protobuf\" data-code=\"// order_event.proto v2&#10;syntax = &quot;proto3&quot;;&#10;&#10;message OrderEvent {&#10;  string order_id = 1;&#10;  int64 amount_cents = 2;&#10;  int64 created_at_ms = 3;&#10;  string currency = 4;&#10;  string note = 5;              // v2 新增&#10;  reserved 6, 7;                // 已删除字段的编号，禁止复用&#10;  reserved &quot;old_status&quot;;        // 已删除字段的名称&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// order_event.proto v2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>syntax = \"proto3\";</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>message OrderEvent {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string order_id = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  int64 amount_cents = 2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  int64 created_at_ms = 3;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string currency = 4;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string note = 5;              // v2 新增</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  reserved 6, 7;                // 已删除字段的编号，禁止复用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  reserved \"old_status\";        // 已删除字段的名称</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>演进规则</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>新增字段：分配新编号，旧消费者忽略未知编号（安全）</li>\n<li>删除字段：用 <code>reserved</code> 标记编号和名称，防止未来复用导致类型冲突</li>\n<li>重命名：只改名称不改编号，线缆兼容（这是 Protobuf 相对 Avro 的关键优势）</li>\n<li>类型变更：极度受限，仅允许 <code>int32↔int64</code>、<code>uint32↔uint64</code> 等同族提升</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>Avro</th>\n<th>Protobuf</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>新增可选字段</td>\n<td>需默认值</td>\n<td>分配新编号即可</td>\n<td>两者均安全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>删除字段</td>\n<td>忽略即可</td>\n<td>reserved 标记</td>\n<td>Protobuf 更显式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重命名字段</td>\n<td>破坏性</td>\n<td>安全（编号不变）</td>\n<td>Protobuf 胜出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型提升</td>\n<td>灵活（union）</td>\n<td>受限（同族）</td>\n<td>Avro 胜出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无外部依赖</td>\n<td>否（需 Registry）</td>\n<td>是（自描述）</td>\n<td>Protobuf 胜出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储效率</td>\n<td>极高（无字段名）</td>\n<td>高（varint 编号）</td>\n<td>Avro 略优</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态语言支持</td>\n<td>好（运行时解析）</td>\n<td>需代码生成</td>\n<td>Avro 胜出</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"json-schema-面向-http-世界的验证\">JSON Schema：面向 HTTP 世界的验证</h2><p>JSON Schema 不是序列化格式，而是验证规范——它定义 JSON 数据应该满足什么结构约束，由验证器在运行时执行检查。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;$schema&quot;: &quot;https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema&quot;,&#10;  &quot;type&quot;: &quot;object&quot;,&#10;  &quot;title&quot;: &quot;OrderEvent&quot;,&#10;  &quot;required&quot;: [&quot;order_id&quot;, &quot;amount_cents&quot;],&#10;  &quot;properties&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;order_id&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;, &quot;format&quot;: &quot;uuid&quot; },&#10;    &quot;amount_cents&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;integer&quot;, &quot;minimum&quot;: 1 },&#10;    &quot;currency&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;, &quot;default&quot;: &quot;CNY&quot;, &quot;enum&quot;: [&quot;CNY&quot;, &quot;USD&quot;, &quot;EUR&quot;] },&#10;    &quot;note&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot; }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;additionalProperties&quot;: false&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"$schema\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"object\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"title\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"OrderEvent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"required\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"amount_cents\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"properties\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"order_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"string\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"format\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"uuid\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"amount_cents\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"integer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"minimum\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"string\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CNY\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"enum\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CNY\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"USD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EUR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"note\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"string\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"additionalProperties\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>兼容性模型的关键开关</strong>：<code>additionalProperties</code>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>false</code>（closed content model）：严格模式，任何未声明字段都会验证失败。新增字段对旧 schema 是破坏性的。</li>\n<li><code>true</code>（open content model）：宽松模式，允许额外字段存在。新增字段对旧 schema 透明。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这个开关直接影响兼容性方向：closed schema 向前兼容难（新字段被旧 schema 拒绝），open schema 向前兼容易但类型安全弱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"选型决策框架\">选型决策框架</h2><p>选择 schema 格式不是一个孤立的技术决策，它与系统架构、团队能力、演进需求紧密耦合。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[选型起点] --&gt; B{主要传输协议?}&#10;    B --&gt;|gRPC| C[Protobuf&lt;br/&gt;gRPC 原生绑定]&#10;    B --&gt;|Kafka/消息队列| D{团队偏好?}&#10;    B --&gt;|REST/HTTP| E[JSON Schema&lt;br/&gt;OpenAPI 原生集成]&#10;    D --&gt;|紧凑+动态| F[Avro&lt;br/&gt;Schema Registry 生态]&#10;    D --&gt;|类型安全+编译期| G[Protobuf&lt;br/&gt;buf 工具链]&#10;    C --&gt; H[配套 buf 做 breaking 检测]&#10;    F --&gt; I[配套 Confluent Registry]&#10;    G --&gt; I&#10;    E --&gt; J[配套 openapi-diff 做变更检测]\">flowchart TD\n    A[选型起点] --&gt; B{主要传输协议?}\n    B --&gt;|gRPC| C[Protobuf&lt;br/&gt;gRPC 原生绑定]\n    B --&gt;|Kafka/消息队列| D{团队偏好?}\n    B --&gt;|REST/HTTP| E[JSON Schema&lt;br/&gt;OpenAPI 原生集成]\n    D --&gt;|紧凑+动态| F[Avro&lt;br/&gt;Schema Registry 生态]\n    D --&gt;|类型安全+编译期| G[Protobuf&lt;br/&gt;buf 工具链]\n    C --&gt; H[配套 buf 做 breaking 检测]\n    F --&gt; I[配套 Confluent Registry]\n    G --&gt; I\n    E --&gt; J[配套 openapi-diff 做变更检测]</pre><p><strong>高频决策模式</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Kafka + 微服务</strong> → Avro（生态最成熟，Confluent 全栈支持）或 Protobuf（跨语言类型安全）</li>\n<li><strong>gRPC 服务间通信</strong> → Protobuf（唯一选择，同时复用到事件定义可减少重复）</li>\n<li><strong>公开 API / Webhook</strong> → JSON Schema（HTTP/JSON 是事实标准）</li>\n<li><strong>数据湖/仓</strong> → Avro 或 Parquet（列存场景 Parquet 内嵌 schema，Avro 用于行式存储）</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"格式共存策略\">格式共存策略</h2><p>实际组织中很少只用一种格式。一个典型的技术栈可能是：gRPC 用 Protobuf、Kafka 用 Avro、REST 用 JSON Schema。此时关键是建立类型定义的单一真相源（single source of truth），通过代码生成在格式间同步：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Protobuf (源)</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>codegen</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>Avro Schema</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>JSON Schema</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>OpenAPI</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Protobuf (源)} \\xrightarrow{\\text{codegen}} \\text{Avro Schema} + \\text{JSON Schema} + \\text{OpenAPI}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3581em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Protobuf (</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">源</span><span class=\"mord\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1081em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">codegen</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Avro Schema</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">JSON Schema</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">OpenAPI</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这避免了同一个实体在不同格式中各自维护、逐渐漂移的问题。<a href=\"contract-ownership-model\">契约所有权模型</a> 会进一步讨论谁来维护这个源、如何在组织中推行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>三种格式代表三种兼容性哲学：Avro 靠运行时 schema 协商，Protobuf 靠字段编号，JSON Schema 靠 <code>additionalProperties</code> 开关。</li>\n<li>选型由传输协议驱动：gRPC → Protobuf、Kafka → Avro/Protobuf、REST/Webhook → JSON Schema、数据湖 → Avro/Parquet。</li>\n<li>没有绝对优劣，只有操作空间的取舍：Avro 动态灵活但依赖 Registry，Protobuf 重命名安全但类型受限，JSON Schema 与 HTTP 天然集成但类型安全弱。</li>\n<li>实际组织很少只用一种格式，关键是建立类型定义的单一真相源，通过代码生成在格式间同步，避免同一实体各自漂移。</li>\n<li>格式是契约演进空间的上限——选错了格式，后面再好的迁移策略也被格式限制卡死。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Schema 定义格式","id":"schema-定义格式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Avro：以 Schema 为中心的演进","id":"avro-以-schema-为中心的演进"},{"level":2,"text":"Protobuf：字段编号即契约","id":"protobuf-字段编号即契约"},{"level":2,"text":"JSON Schema：面向 HTTP 世界的验证","id":"json-schema-面向-http-世界的验证"},{"level":2,"text":"选型决策框架","id":"选型决策框架"},{"level":2,"text":"格式共存策略","id":"格式共存策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"数据契约全景","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/schema-evolution-data-contracts/foundations/data-contracts-overview"},"next":{"title":"契约所有权模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/schema-evolution-data-contracts/foundations/contract-ownership-model"}}